<title>USA: Magten cuts Revco stake to 7.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Magten cuts Revco stake to 7.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magten Asset Management Corp said Tuesday it lowered its stake in Revco D.S. Inc to 4,981,649 common shares or 7.3 percent from 8.8 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York based investment adviser said its latest transactions include sales of 1,035,000 common shares between September 27 and October 2 and priced at $28.86 and $29.50 per share.</p>
</text>
